<Item XName="Note" UserName="Note" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt; &#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-ascii-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in; mso-element: para-border-div; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt; mso-padding-alt: 0in 0in 1.0pt 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian&apos;&gt;NR UL Tx&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;I&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue Example&amp;nbsp;Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;This example workspace demonstrates spectrum, EVM, ACLR and CCDF measurements for an NR uplink transmitter. FRC uplink cases in 38.101-1 are also shown in design FRC.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In Design 1, numerology is 15kHz and&amp;nbsp;bandwidth is set to&amp;nbsp;50MHz (270 RB). PUSCH is transmitted with RB 0~269 and symbol 1~13.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Overall the followings are the features supported in the example.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;NR transmitter signal with multiple numerologies&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-spacerun: yes&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;2.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Spectrum, EVM, ACLR and CCDF measurements are supported&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;3.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;EVM measurement is based on VSA with&amp;nbsp;auto generated&amp;nbsp;VSA setup-file&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The followings are the results after simulation:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Transmit spectrum (see&lt;B&gt; Spectrum &lt;/B&gt;Graph)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;2.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Waveform of uplink transmitter (see &lt;B&gt;Waveform&lt;/B&gt; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;A name=OLE_LINK1&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Graph&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;4.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;ACLR (see &lt;B&gt;ACLR_Table&lt;/B&gt; Table)&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;5.&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-spacerun: yes&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;CCDF (see &lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;CCDF&lt;/B&gt; Graph)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;NR EVM measurement&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The EVM measurement is based on VSA and version of VSA should be&amp;nbsp;VSA 2018 Update 1.0&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;or later version. Please exit VSA instance before starting new simulation.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;EVM model is based on 3GPP specification version 15.2.0.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Filter is added to the demodulated signal if UseMcFilter (EVM model) is set to Yes and the same filter is used in VSA model by default setup file.&amp;nbsp;According to the definition of SNR in 3GPP, it is the signal to noise ratio in bandwidth. In this model, if filter is not used, noise&amp;nbsp;will be calculated on&amp;nbsp;the whole band of samplingrate, in this case, EVM result may be 3dB worse when OversamplingOption is set to Ratio 2 compared to set to Ratio 1. If filter is used, impairment of filter may introduce performance degradation in noiseless scenario, EVM may around -70dB instead of -120dB, but this degradation disappears in noisy scenario.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;ACLR measurement&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;ACLR is calculate by equation ACLR using spectrum data in Design Analysis_Design_Data/FRC Analysis_FRC_Data. Please keep the parameters in ACLR equation shown below consistent with the parameters in Design. Please set OversamplingOption no less than 2(Ratio 4) when calculated ACLR.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;FR1 &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;bandwidth = 50e6; %%%Hz&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;FCarrier = 1e9; %%% Hz &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;CarrierNumRBs = 270;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;SCS = 15e3; %%%Hz&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Please run the equation if spectrum data are updated.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Spectrum shanpping&amp;nbsp;is added in Source to ensure ACLR performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;CCDF measurement&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Reference curve (CCDF of white gaussian noise) is also plotted on these graphs.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Refer to subclause 6.1.4 of TS38.214, using parameters Modulation, TBS and location of PUSCH, same frame configuration can be set. Please refer to Note of example NR_DL_Tx on &lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;How to set MCS using parameters in example.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;FRC&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;FRC design is based on A.2 of 3GPP 38.101-1 v15.4.0. If there are several cases of different number of allocated resource block&amp;nbsp;in the same bandwidth in one table, please use parameter TestCase to choose different case. Number of RBs of Case1 to Case 6 is in ascending order, for example, in table &lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&apos;&gt;A.2.2.1-1 &lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;for bandwidth 5MHz, number of RBs for Case 1 is 1, Case 2 is 12 and Case 3 is 25. This design is based on FR1. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Calibri&gt;Paremeters for different table are set in Equation. The rest of parameters which are not list in A.2 are set in Source model and EVM model. Please make sure parameters consistent for those two models. PUCCH is not enabled. OCNG is not supported in EVM model, so Fill_OCNG is set to NO in source model in this desgin.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Calibri&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Calibri&gt;If OperationMode is FDD, FRC_Table specifies the tables defined in A.2.2. If it&apos;s TDD, FRC_Table selects the tables defined in A.2.3.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Calibri&gt;In TDD mode, EVM model only measure the first active slot in a radio frame.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Note:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Some results in datasheet are deleted to decrease the size of this example, please run simulation to get the results.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;NR uplink numerology source is updated to 3GPP specification v15.3.0. The version of EVM model is v15.2.0. In order to make the demodulation successful, it is important to make the parameters make sense for those two models.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Some results in datasheet are deleted because the size of this example. Please rerun analysis to get the total results.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Constellation can be shown when parameter SaveConstellation set to YES in EVM model.Constellation Graph may take more time to plot the graph due to huge number of points,&amp;nbsp;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;in this case, please set parameter EVM_NumSlots in Equation which is the number of slots of demodulated PUSCH to shorten the time&amp;nbsp;plotting constellation. For now, EVM_NumSlots&amp;nbsp;is set to 5 in Design1 and it is set&amp;nbsp;to different value in FRC by different cases.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 14px; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(23,43,77); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT color=#000000&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Calibri&gt;EVM model will internally calculate&amp;nbsp;Numerology_k0 with the configured GridStart according to definition in 5.3 of 38.211.&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;EVM measurements might be&amp;nbsp;wrong in case of multiple different Numerologies setting&amp;nbsp;with Resource&lt;!--__SearchResult__2--&gt;&lt;/A&gt;GridEnable for NR_Source&amp;nbsp;disabled, where Numerology_k0 is&amp;nbsp;set manually by users, unless&amp;nbsp;it is&amp;nbsp;calculated&amp;nbsp;and set correctly. Therefore, Resource&lt;!--__SearchResult__3--&gt;&lt;/A&gt;GridEnable is set to YES by default in this example.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;</Text>
